#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanja igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kpeg; configuration dialog allows you to select visual themes for "
"&kpeg;."
msgstr ""
"&kpeg; dijalog podešavanja vam omogućava da odaberete vizualne teme za "
"&kpeg;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme's name from the selection list."
msgstr ""
"Da biste izabrali novu temu jednostavno izaberite ime teme sa liste za izbor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Bilješka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For your convenience a quick preview screenshot will be displayed on the "
"right hand sided of the selection list as soon as you select the theme you "
"are interested in."
msgstr ""
"Radi Vaše udobnosti brzi pregled slike ekrana će biti prikazan na desnoj "
"strani  liste za izbor čim ste odabrali temu koja vas zanima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can either click "
"the <guibutton>Apply</guibutton>, or simply click the <guibutton>Ok</"
"guibutton> button, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste zadovoljni s temom koju ste izabrali možete kliknuti na "
"<guibutton>Prihvatite</guibutton>, ili jednostavno kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Ok</guibutton>, koji se nalazi na donjem dijelu ovog dijaloga."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If, however you are dissatisfied with your selection – simply click "
"<guimenu>Cancel</guimenu> to discard the changes."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste međutim, nezadovoljni svojim izboomr - jednostavno kliknite "
"<guimenu>Odustani</guimenu> za odbacivanje promjena."

